# Ruling: Germinate Recruits counts the total life gained without taking account of life lost. Bot1 bolts itself (-3, 17),
# gains 3 from Healing Salve (20), then casts Germinate Recruits: X is 3, not 0, so three Cadets, and Bot1 ends at 20.

